<title>INDIA: India's Parke Davis 1996/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India's Parke Davis 1996/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    97.97     vs	76.24</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	5.0	vs	 4.5</p>
<p>   *Net Sales	  1,529.2	vs   1,552.0</p>
<p>  **Other income	  68.50     vs     116.4</p>
<p>    Expenditure	1,370.4	vs   1,396.9</p>
<p>    Interest		34.1	vs	25.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  30.7	vs	14.1</p>
<p>    Tax		     64.5	vs	29.0</p>
<p>Note: Parke Davis (India) Ltd said the previous year's sales include *sales of 158.9 million rupees of discontinued confectionery business. The company said last year's **other income includes non-recurring income of 74.8 million rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
